---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ExternalLink from '../components/ExternalLink.astro';
import { aboutSchema, getDirectory } from '../lib/content';
const { agents } = await getDirectory();
---

<Base
  title="About Top Realtors Cypress TX | How the Guide Works"
  description="How Top Realtors Cypress TX builds its realtor profiles: public HAR records and realtor websites, linked sources, labeled self-reported claims and dated checks."
  path="/about.html"
  schema={aboutSchema()}
>
  <main id="main" class="wrap legal">
    <span class="eyebrow">About this guide</span>
    <h1>About Top Realtors Cypress TX</h1>
    <p>
      Top Realtors Cypress TX helps people buying, selling or renting in
      Cypress, Texas compare local realtors before the first call. It covers{' '}
      {agents.length} agents, teams and brokerages.
    </p>
    <h2>How we build each profile</h2>
    <p>
      We read each realtor’s HAR profile, sales and lease history, public client
      comments and website. Every fact links to the page we read it on. Awards
      and totals a realtor publishes about themselves are marked as
      self-reported, and anything we can’t verify stays off the page.
    </p>
    <h2>How the list is ordered</h2>
    <p>
      The Lippincott Team is our #1 choice, an editorial recommendation rather
      than a calculated ranking. Everyone else is listed A to Z. HAR ratings
      belong to the named individual and don’t decide the order.
    </p>
    <h2>What we don’t do</h2>
    <p>
      We don’t collect contact details, forward inquiries, set fees, or audit
      sales and reviews. Confirm licensing, brokerage, services and fees with
      each realtor, and check licenses with{' '}
      <ExternalLink href="https://www.trec.texas.gov/license-search/">
        TREC’s License Holder Search
      </ExternalLink>
      .
    </p>
    <h2>How current it is</h2>
    <p>
      We checked our sources on October 14 and 15, 2026. Each rating shows its
      own check date. Our <a href="/terms.html">Terms</a> page explains who runs
      this site.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="/#directory">Compare the realtors</a>
    </p>
  </main>
</Base>
